      "markdown": "解法 4:  $ F(x)=\\frac{g(x)}{f(x)}=\\frac{\\sin(2x+\\frac{\\pi}{4})}{\\sin(2x-\\frac{\\pi}{4})} $，定义域为  $ \\left\\{x\\mid x\\neq\\frac{\\pi}{8}+\\frac{k\\pi}{2},k\\in Z\\right\\} $\n\n $$ F^{\\prime}(x)=\\frac{2\\cos(2x+\\frac{\\pi}{4})\\sin(2x-\\frac{\\pi}{4})-2\\cos(2x-\\frac{\\pi}{4})\\sin(2x+\\frac{\\pi}{4})}{\\sin^{2}(2x-\\frac{\\pi}{4})}=\\frac{-2}{\\sin^{2}(2x-\\frac{\\pi}{4})}<0 $$ \n\n$\\therefore F(x)$ 的单调递减区间为 $\\left(-\\frac{3\\pi}{8}+\\frac{k\\pi}{2},\\frac{\\pi}{8}+\\frac{k\\pi}{2}\\right)k\\in Z$，无递增区间.\n\n评分标准：\n\n(1)  $ g(x) $ 表达式正确2分，\n\n $$ -\\tan(2x+\\frac{\\pi}{4}) $$ \n\n(3) 单调区间正确1分。\n\n $$ \\frac{1}{\\tan(2x-\\frac{\\pi}{4})},1+\\frac{2}{\\tan2x-1},\\frac{-2}{\\sin^{2}(2x-\\frac{\\pi}{4})}< $$ \n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_504_1104_903_1366.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"16%\" /></div>\n\n\n注：1.有正确的体积公式，h没算对，这2分也给！\n\n2. 没有写出以上的任何一个踩分点，去证明 A1E 垂直与平面 ABCD 的，给 2 分\n\n18.（本小题满分12分）\n\n18.（本小题满分12分）\n\n(1) 如图，取AB中点O，连\n\n $ OA_{1}, OB_{1} $\n\n $ \\because AA_{1}=AB_{1}=B_{1}B=1, AB=2 $\n\n $ \\therefore OA=OB=\\#AA_{1}=A_{1}B_{1}=1, \\textcircled{2} $\n\n $ \\textcircled{3} $ 即  $ B_{1}O_{1}AA_{1} $，四边\n\n\n\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_747_1604_1018_1806.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"10%\" /></div>\n\n\n $$ \\therefore A A_{1}=A_{1}O=A O $$ \n\n $$ \\begin{array}{c} ABCD - A_{1}B_{1}C_{1}D_{1} = \\frac{7\\sqrt{3}}{16} = \\frac{1}{3}(S_{上} + S_{下} + \\sqrt{S_{上}S_{下}}) \\cdot h \\\\ S_{下} = (1 + 2) \\times 1 \\times \\frac{1}{2} = \\frac{3}{2} \\end{array} $$ \n\n18. 解：（1）连接  $ AD_{1} $，因为  $ AE \\parallel D_{1}C_{1} $，所以 A, E,  $ C_{1}, D_{1} $ 四点共面，\n\n因为 $ C_{1}E// $平面 $ ADD_{1}A_{1} $， $ AD_{1} $是过 $ C_{1}E $的平面 $ AEC_{1}D_{1} $与平面 $ ADD_{1}A_{1} $的交线\n\n由线面平行的性质定理，知  $ AD_{1} // C_{1}E $\n\n所以四边形  $ AEC_{1}D_{1} $ 为平行四边形 2分\n\n所以  $ AE = D_{1}C_{1} = \\frac{1}{2}DC = \\frac{1}{2} $\n\n $$ \\angle A_{1}AE=60^{\\circ} $$ \n\n $$ AA_{1}=1 $$ \n\n $$ A_{1}E=\\sqrt{AA_{1}^{2}+AE^{2}-2AA_{1}\\cdot AE\\cdot\\cos60^{\\circ}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}^{2分}， $$ \n\n $$ A_{1}E\\perp AB $$ \n\n $$ \\mathrm{i}_{1}=\\frac{3}{4},\\quad S_{2}=\\frac{3}{2} $$ \n\n $$ \\frac{7\\sqrt{3}}{16}=\\frac{h}{3}(S_{1}+\\sqrt{S_{1}S_{2}}+S_{2})=\\frac{h}{3}(\\frac{3}{4}+\\frac{3}{8}+\\frac{3}{2})=\\frac{7}{8}h $$ \n\n有体积公式，给2分\n\n $$ h=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} $$ \n\n $$ AA_{1}B_{1}B\\perp $$ \n\n $$ BC\\perp AB $$ \n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_407_2372_871_2685.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"18%\" /></div>\n\n\n $$ BCC_{1}B_{1}\\perp $$ \n\n $$ AA_{1}B_{1}B $$ \n\n $$ EH\\perp BB_{1} 于 H $$ \n\n $$ EH\\perp $$ \n\n $$ BCC_{1}B_{1} $$ \n\n $$ \\angle E C_{1}H $$ \n\n $$ C_{1}E $$ \n\n $$ BCC_{1}B_{1} $$ \n\n $$ EH=BE\\sin60^{\\circ}=\\frac{3\\sqrt{3}}{4} $$ \n\n $$ C_{1}E^{2}=C_{1}B_{1}^{2}+B_{1}E^{2}=C_{1}B_{1}^{2}+BE^{2}+BB_{1}^{2}-2\\cdot BB_{1}\\cdot BE\\cdot\\cos60^{\\circ}=2 $$ \n\n $$ C_{1}E=\\sqrt{2} $$ \n\n $$ \\sin\\angle EC_{1}H=\\frac{EH}{C_{1}E}=\\frac{3\\sqrt{6}}{8} $$ ",
